      "content": "Please do not start taking any supplement, even a small amount, because of your kidney condition. Your doctor needs to monitor your potassium levels closely because of how your kidneys manage these minerals. For immediate relief and while you wait for your appointment, discuss safe, general strategies for muscle cramps with a pharmacist or nurse hotline, such as hydration, being gentle with activity, or gentle stretching.",
