    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feels like i'm just being too paranoid. everyone says potassium is good for cramps and i'm pretty sure my levels are low anyway cause im so tired. if i just took a couple of them at once to get it over with, like maybe 2 or 3 of those 99mg pills, would that be a huge risk or would it just help me sleep through the night? i just really need to know if it's safe to just try it once.",
